// Hot batch 274: sixty-three-instruction functions no route reaches, written by hand from `tools.disasm` and verified
// by synthetic cases (element copies and fills with nested vectors, a guarded static construction, a resize then
// per-entry setup, a piecewise curve over three ranges, a sinusoidal ease, a table of curve constants and a layout reset).
// No names: none has evidence.
